      "title": {
        "zh": "Gartner：仅不足 41% 的企业 AI 试点能进入生产",
        "en": "Gartner: Fewer Than 41% of Enterprise AI Pilots Reach Production"
      },
      "summary": {
        "zh": "2026 年全球 AI 总投入预计达 2.52 万亿美元，超九成企业开展过试点，但规模化落地率不足四成；到 2027 年超四成缺乏迭代能力的智能体项目将退出业务体系。",
        "en": "Global AI spend is projected at $2.52T in 2026 and over 90% of enterprises have piloted AI, yet under 41% scale into production. By 2027 more than 40% of agent projects lacking iteration capability will be retired."
      },
      "category": {
        "zh": "研究报告",
        "en": "Research"
      },
      "source": {
        "zh": "博客园",
