      },
      "summary": {
        "zh": "Palantir 2026 年二季度营收大幅增长并上调全年指引，带动 FDE 概念升温。国联民生证券研报称 FDE 有望成为连接模型厂商、软件服务商与行业客户的关键组织形态。",
        "en": "Palantir's Q2 2026 revenue jumped and full-year guidance was raised, heating up the FDE theme. Guolian Minsheng Securities says FDE may become the key organisational form linking model vendors, software providers and industry clients."
