      "summary": {
        "zh": "北京、武汉已将 FDE 写入智能体专项政策。IDC 指出部分服务商只是给传统驻场换了标签，真正拉开差距的是交付逻辑能否说清与传统实施的实质区别。",
        "en": "Beijing and Wuhan have written FDE into agent policies. IDC warns some vendors merely rebadge traditional onsite delivery; the real differentiator is articulating how delivery logic truly differs."
