      "id": "ai-9",
      "slug": "fde-20260806-957d0823",
      "title": {
        "zh": "联想以 FDE 模式驻扎佛山车间，落地城市超级智能体",
        "en": "Lenovo Embeds FDEs in Foshan Factories for City-Scale AI Agents"
      },
      "summary": {
        "zh": "「佛山市人工智能赋能制造业数智服务平台」进入交付阶段，联想将架构师与工程师以 FDE 模式驻扎生产车间，后方设「擎天创新实验室」持续迭代工业智能体。",
        "en": "As Foshan's AI manufacturing platform enters delivery, Lenovo has embedded architects and engineers on the shop floor under an FDE model, backed by a lab continuously iterating industrial agents."
      },
      "category": {
        "zh": "落地案例",
        "en": "Case Study"
      },
      "source": {
        "zh": "今日头条",
        "en": "Toutiao"
      },
      "date": "2026-08-06",
      "link": "https://www.toutiao.com/article/7670812778755523122"
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-10",
      "slug": "fde-20260805-bd582a96",
      "title": {
        "zh": "腾讯研究院报告：FDE 模式行业观察与实践",
        "en": "Tencent Research Institute: Industry Report on the FDE Model"
      },
      "summary": {
        "zh": "报告指出 AI 落地矛盾正从「模型能不能做」转向「组织怎么用」；FDE 与传统驻场的本质区别，在于项目结束后能否沉淀为可复用资产。",
        "en": "The report finds the bottleneck shifting from model capability to organisational adoption, and defines the real FDE difference as whether field experience is distilled into reusable assets."
      },
      "category": {
        "zh": "研究报告",
        "en": "Research"
      },
      "source": {
        "zh": "36氪",
        "en": "36Kr"
      },
      "date": "2026-08-05",
      "link": "https://36kr.com/p/3926404419910018"
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-11",
