      "title": {
        "zh": "瓴羊 FDE 驻场雅迪：78 场调研重构 4 万门店客服体系",
        "en": "Lingyang's FDE Team Rebuilds Yadea's Service Across 40,000 Stores"
      },
      "summary": {
        "zh": "FDE 团队进场后横跨十几个部门开展 78 场深度驻场调研，反复听用户热线录音，分两期落地一体化工作台、坐席辅助与热线机器人。",
        "en": "The FDE team ran 78 deep onsite studies across a dozen departments, repeatedly listening to hotline recordings, then delivered a unified workbench, agent assist and hotline bots in two phases."
      },
