      "slug": "fde-20260804-15a5731b",
      "title": {
        "zh": "FDX 登场：继 FDE 之后出现「前线部署高管」",
        "en": "Enter FDX: The Forward Deployed Executive Emerges After FDE"
      },
      "summary": {
        "zh": "MIT 材料学博士 Rick Manelius 提出，若 FDE 是 AI 项目的「外置 CTO」，FDX 就是「外置 CEO」——帮高管识别问题、设定优先级并跨越组织与心理门槛。",
        "en": "MIT PhD Rick Manelius argues that if the FDE is an AI project's outsourced CTO, the FDX is its outsourced CEO — helping executives frame problems, set priorities and clear organisational barriers."
      },
      "category": {
