      },
      "summary": {
        "zh": "摒弃按人天核算，国内外双市场统一实行效果付费、收益共担。批量项目实现信贷不良压降 3%–10%、后台运营人力缩减 20% 以上、监管报送工作量降低 60%。",
        "en": "Dropping day-rate billing for outcome-based, risk-sharing pricing across both markets, its projects cut NPLs by 3–10%, back-office headcount by over 20% and regulatory reporting effort by 60%."
